@startuml
title Job Application Status State Machine

[*] --> NoStatus : New job discovered (status='--')

NoStatus --> Saved : User saves job
NoStatus --> Archived : User manually archives

Saved --> Applied : User submits application
Saved --> Archived : User manually archives
Saved --> NoStatus : User resets status

Applied --> Interview : Recruiter responds
Applied --> Rejected : Application rejected
Applied --> Archived : User manually archives

Interview --> Offer : Pass interview
Interview --> Rejected : Rejected after interview
Interview --> Archived : User manually archives

Offer --> Archived : Offer accepted or expires
Rejected --> Archived : User manually archives

Archived --> Saved : User un-archives
Archived --> Applied : User un-archives
Archived --> Interview : User un-archives
Archived --> NoStatus : User un-archives

note right of NoStatus
  status = '--'
  No emoji marker
end note

note right of Saved
  status = 'Saved'
end note

note right of Applied
  status = 'Applied 📤'
  Cannot go back to -- or Saved
end note

note right of Interview
  status = 'Interview 🤝'
  Cannot go back to --, Saved, or Applied
end note

note right of Offer
  status = 'Offer 🎉'
  Terminal — can only go to Archived
end note

note right of Rejected
  status = 'Rejected ❌'
  Terminal — can only go to Archived
end note

note left of Archived
  Excluded from default results (WHERE status != 'Archived')
  Not deleted — row preserved with status_history
  Can transition to ANY status (un-archive)
end note

@enduml
